# Renting Cloud (monthly subscription) and iCloud sync.
# The paywall and the subscription terms are translated into all 9 languages (the App Store asks
# for them in every localization). The iCloud status/settings screens are en + es for now; the other
# 7 languages fall back to English (TODO: de fr it pt ar hi zh-Hans).
# Order: en, es, de, fr, it, pt, ar, hi, zh-Hans
def k2(key, en, es):
    k(key, en, es, en, en, en, en, en, en, en)

